  "subtitle": {
    "en": "How an Alien AI in 2026 Sees Religion, Power, Biology, and the Possibility of Transcendence",
    "fr": "How an Alien AI in 2026 Sees Religion, Power, Biology, and the Possibility of Transcendence",
